  "description": "Walmart Was The Warning Signal I Forecasted A Year Ago...",
  "body_html": "<p>Lets start with some good news. I want to start the week with some positive energy. I am still very bullish on the S&amp;P 500 and the Russell 2000. Silver I think is going to have a euphoric run in the coming months, causing me to <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/weve-been-right-so-far-here-where?r=4z8lgl\">buy another mining company stock (click here)</a>. So there is good news. </p><h4>I AM BULLISH ON THOSE</h4><p>However, there is also reality. We are watching, rather randomly, companies collapse on themselves. Last week we had more stocks making 52 week lows than 52 week highs (73 highs to 80 lows).<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> </p><p>Almost exactly 1 year ago, one of the major warning signals of a market collapse, that I was watching for, was for a popular stock… Costco and/or Walmart… to crash. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png\" width=\"465\" height=\"385\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:385,&quot;width&quot;:465,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:215964,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212539183?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1KW3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6462a1a6-8bf3-461b-ad77-d364ce95cbd5_465x385.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I cannot sit here, watch Walmart crash -10% at earnings, -24% since the peak, and pretend like everything is fine. This would be disregarding my own forecasts! </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>The point being, individual stock picking is getting harder, and individual names are blowing up randomly and unexpectedly. And because of that, <strong>I am looking to consolidate. </strong></p><p>Many of my positions have 2 choices:</p><ol><li><p>Go up from current price levels, or;</p></li><li><p>Get sold. </p></li></ol><h4>This does not mean sprint to your portfolio and sell everything!</h4><p>You can check out the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">StockTok Summary</a> </strong>for updated notes and “cut levels” for each of my positions. We have several winning stocks that we compounded the wins on the way up…specifically regional banks. And 2 positions that are deep in the red. My intention is to not have that list of “red” stocks grow, erasing gains from prior years and even earlier this year. </p><h4>Do NOT get married to this rough timeline: </h4><p>I expect more all time highs from the S&amp;P 500 and the Russell 2000. I am incredibly bullish on silver. But I expect those indexes to top out around October or November, and Silver a few months after that. As always, we will update as we go. </p><h4>This is NOT  a TOP CALL! I do not think TOPS ARE IN. </h4><h4>Changes and cut prices to the portfolio include: (down below)…</h4><p>Also, 2 stocks I am looking to buy to capitalize on blow off top…</p>",
